New Pricing tiers block: price cards side by side, each with a name, tag, price, price note, description, features and a button. Card colour, tag colour and button style are set for all tiers and can be changed per tier; one tier can be highlighted (a little taller, with a `juizi-pricing__tier--highlighted` class for themes). Choose 2 to 5 cards in a row on large screens (4 by default); phones get a swipeable carousel, one card at a time, which can open on the highlighted tier (autoplay then stays off) and have arrows above, below or on each side of the card. Works with and without Volto Light Theme. The Content Row's mobile carousel and rich text display moved to `_shared/` (`MobileCarousel`, `RichText`) so both blocks use them; the Content Row's markup is unchanged.
